# Copy this file to `.env` for local secrets, then run/build with:
#   flutter run --dart-define-from-file=.env
#
# `.env` is gitignored; in CI these values come from repo secrets instead.
#
# Maps use Mapbox. The public access token is embedded in the app
# (lib/core/config/map_config.dart) — override it here only if you want a
# Shoein'-specific token:
#   MAPBOX_ACCESS_TOKEN=pk....
#
# Building also needs Mapbox's *secret downloads token* (MAPBOX_DOWNLOADS_TOKEN,
# scope downloads:read) in your global ~/.gradle/gradle.properties (Android) and
# ~/.netrc (iOS) — the same setup the Prior app uses. That is NOT a dart-define.
